WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:02.250
- Our first guest, though,
knows a thing or two

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.480
about bestselling albums.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.740
He's so incredibly talented.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.380
He's sold over 75 million worldwide

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.323
and won five Grammys, no big deal.

00:00:09.323 --> 00:00:11.723
(audience cheering)
But now he's got a whiskey.

00:00:11.723 --> 00:00:13.287
It's called Fraser &amp; Thompson,

00:00:13.287 --> 00:00:15.810
and it's available online and
at select spirit retailers.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.647
So please welcome my Buble!

00:00:17.647 --> 00:00:18.480
Mi-- What?

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.480
(jazzy music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:31.059 --> 00:00:32.476
- Hey there.
- Hi.

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:36.783
- Did you me say "my
Buble" instead of Michael?

00:00:36.783 --> 00:00:37.957
- No, but I like it.

00:00:37.957 --> 00:00:40.992
- Cool, cool.
- That's nice.

00:00:40.992 --> 00:00:41.825
Hi everybody!

00:00:41.825 --> 00:00:45.658
(audience continues cheering)

00:00:46.981 --> 00:00:49.440
- I love that it at least happened

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:50.837
with you, because you're funny.

00:00:50.837 --> 00:00:51.670
(Michael laughs)

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.300
So I literally, instead
"--chael," I said "my Buble!"

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.133
Instead of Michael Buble.
- That's so cute.

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:56.490
- You're now mine.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:57.840
Yeah.
- I want to be your Buble.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.580
- I just collected you.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.410
- I want to be your--
- How are you?

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:02.880
- Hi, Kelly Clarkson!
- Hi!

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.590
- [Michael] Happy New Year,
how was your New Year?

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:07.168
- Thank you, New Year's
was great, I did a show!

00:01:07.168 --> 00:01:08.501
What did you do?

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:10.830
- I hung out with the family.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.720
I was in Miami.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.300
It was amazing.
(audience laughing)

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.030
I have four kids.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:19.312
- Four kids?
- Yeah.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.810
- Do you sleep?
- Do I sleep?

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:22.643
No--
- I've had four kids

00:01:22.643 --> 00:01:23.476
in my household at once before.

00:01:23.476 --> 00:01:24.309
That's a lot.

00:01:24.309 --> 00:01:25.950
- I'm too busy making kids.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.420
Congratulations on that.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.370
Okay.
- Thank you.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:31.530
- Do you ever, do y'all
make resolutions or goals

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:32.460
or anything, do y'all do that?

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.293
- Yeah, of course, yeah.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:34.140
- Okay, what are some of yours?

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.272
- Mine was go to the gym every single day.

00:01:36.272 --> 00:01:37.890
- Oh.
- Eat no more,

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.360
no more carbs, no more sugars.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.770
- Okay.

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:42.396
So how long did it last?
- I failed everything.

00:01:42.396 --> 00:01:43.680
- Yeah.
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.513
- Lasted until the second.

00:01:44.513 --> 00:01:47.430
- Yeah, I don't even set
that goal anymore, man.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:49.320
I don't even, I'm like, why lie to myself?

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.250
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.210
I could die tomorrow.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.110
I'm gonna die with sugar on my tongue.

